<!doctype html><html lang="mr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#172033"><link rel="manifest" href="/static/manifest.webmanifest"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css"><title><%=appName%></title></head><body><div class="wrap"><div class="nav"><div class="brand">🏘️ <%=appName%></div><a class="btn" href="/posts">LIVE Posts</a></div><div class="card"><h1>पोस्ट प्रकाशित करण्यासाठी ₹<%=amount%></h1><p class="muted">UPI payment केल्यानंतर खाली <b>UTR Number + Payment Screenshot</b> दोन्ही submit करा. Admin verification नंतर पोस्ट LIVE होईल.</p><% if(error){%><div class="error"><%=error%></div><%}%><form action="/payment" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><div class="grid"><div><label>नाव</label><input name="name" required maxlength="80"></div><div><label>मोबाईल</label><input name="mobile" required maxlength="30" inputmode="tel"></div></div><div class="qrbox"><b>UPI ID</b><p class="utr"><%=upiId%></p><p>Amount: <b>₹<%=amount%></b></p><p class="muted">तुमच्या UPI app मधून payment करा.</p></div><label>UTR / Transaction ID</label><input name="utr" required maxlength="40" placeholder="उदा. 123456789012" autocomplete="off"><label>Payment Screenshot</label><input type="file" name="screenshot" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" required><label>तुमची पोस्ट</label><textarea name="post_text" required maxlength="1000" placeholder="तुमची जाहिरात / माहिती..."></textarea><button type="submit">Payment Details Submit करा</button></form></div></div><script>if('serviceWorker'in navigator)navigator.serviceWorker.register('/static/sw.js').catch(()=>{});</script></body></html>
